Can I do partial work?
Is my rate fixed?
Are deadlines fixed?

If YES YES YES → EDF.

If ANY is NO → NOT EDF.



When is EDF (Earliest Deadline First) applicable?

EDF is applicable iff all three are true:

Condition	Meaning
1️⃣ Fixed deadlines	Each task has a fixed time when it must finish
2️⃣ Uniform processing rate	You can do a constant amount of work per unit time
3️⃣ Work is divisible	You can partially process tasks

If all three hold, EDF is provably optimal.